edia\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"495e6aac11ce5553\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rail_suicide\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3dc2bf2904791e8c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nIn written testimony to the British Parliament, Samaritans said that <strong>in 2014–15 suicides cost Network Rail £67 million, averaging about £230,000 per incident</strong>, with 2,200 minutes of delays per incident adding up to 609,000 annually.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"3dc2bf2904791e8c\\\">>>\",\n      \"published\": \"4 days ago\",\n      \"siteName\": \"en.wikipedia.org\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"14cff54283097849\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n1 EUROSTAT 2019.27.06 Rail accident fatalities in the EU\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"14cff54283097849\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.sipotra.it/wp-content/uploads/2019/06/Rail-accident-fatalities-in-the-EU.pdf\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"932a10f3ce5f6082\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nThe railway accident data collected by ERA data are located in the “Horizontal multi-modal information · (tran)” section under “Transport safety (tran_sf)” in Eurobase.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"932a10f3ce5f6082\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"www.sipotra.it\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"96b0c202711e1a6d\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTables EUROSTAT · opendata tables - bowerth\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"96b0c202711e1a6d\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://bowerth.gitbooks.io/opendata-tables/content/mdtable/content/eurostat_tables.html\",\n      \"description\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dfdc4393136a29fa\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nPowered by GitBook · Tables EUROSTAT · EUROSTAT\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"dfdc4393136a29fa\\